# Butler Routes - Arathi Highlands completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Alliance route through the contested Highlands: Refuge Pointe holds the hub,
# Stromgarde's streets are worked as their own block, the Myzrael binding
# stones and Faldir's Cove run as full chains, and the far legs (Wetlands,
# Hillsbrad, Ironforge, Stormwind, Stranglethorn, Desolace, Ravenholdt,
# Razorfen Kraul, Riverglades, Alterac) ride as labeled expeditions. Chain
# order is strictly per quest data: no link is accepted before its prerequisite
# turns in. EVERY accept belongs to the 47-quest contract in
# docs/quest-contracts.json; the Eagle's Fist chain closes here via the banked
# Carved Figurine. See docs/arathi-census.md for the census.
guide butler-routes-completionist/arathi-highlands
title Arathi Highlands - Completionist
levels 30-40
zone Arathi Highlands
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Refuge Pointe - arrival

  tip Refuge Pointe is the Alliance hub: Captain Nials (45.83, 47.56) holds the Stromgarde line, the Wanted Board (46.04, 47.76) posts the bounties, Apprentice Kryten (46.2, 47.75) and Skuerto (46.65, 47.01) work the tower, and Muggol Breezebeard (48.68, 55.78) takes writs.
  accept 681 -- Northfold Manor - Captain Nials
  accept 684 -- WANTED: Marez Cowl - the Wanted Board
  accept 685 -- WANTED: Otto and Falconcrest - the Wanted Board
  accept 691 -- Worth Its Weight in Gold - Apprentice Kryten
  accept 95315 -- The Riverglades Report - Captain Nials
  note The Riverglades Report rides the Farholde expedition at the end.
  accept 94221 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Golden Rod - Muggol Breezebeard; have the Golden Rod in your bags
  note The writs are optional: have each requested good in your bags before taking the turn-in leg.

step Northfold Manor - highwaymen and mercenaries

  complete 681 @29.05,28.38 era -- 10 Syndicate Highwaymen and 6 Syndicate Mercenaries for Captain Nials
  accept 96784 only Rogue -- Master of Disguise - the Syndicate Footlocker (32.29, 26.57)
  note The footlocker starts the Rogue's Stromgarde Keep line; its pre (96783) lives outside this contract. The rest of that line runs in the streets below.

step Stromgarde west - Lomar, Alaric and Anastasia

  tip Groundskeeper Lomar (27, 57.2) and Caretaker Alaric (28.98, 59.68) work the west gate; Anastasia Miller (26.81, 64.44) waits further in.
  accept 92867 -- Ground to Keep - Groundskeeper Lomar
  accept 92872 -- Dutiful Steps - Caretaker Alaric
  note Alaric's pouch goes into the sea on any coast; have it thrown before you report back.
  turnin 96784 only Rogue -- Master of Disguise - Anastasia Miller
  accept 96785 only Rogue -- Ain't No Telling - Anastasia Miller
  complete 96785 only Rogue @26.81,64.44 era -- have the Stolen Funds in your bags; the funds name no placed source in the data

step Stromgarde streets - heads and intruders

  complete 684 @29.47,64.14 era -- Marez Cowl for Captain Nials
  complete 685 @26.22,65.55 era -- Otto and Lord Falconcrest for Captain Nials

  complete 92867 @17.51,68.38 era -- the Boulderfist, Syndicate and Witherbark intruders in the keep for Groundskeeper Lomar

step Stromgarde west - dust and duty paid

  turnin 92867 -- Ground to Keep - Groundskeeper Lomar
  turnin 92872 -- Dutiful Steps - Caretaker Alaric
  turnin 96785 only Rogue -- Ain't No Telling - Anastasia Miller
  accept 96786 only Rogue -- The Syndicate Sting - Anastasia Miller
  complete 96786 only Rogue @26.81,64.44 era -- have the Intercepted Shipment in your bags; it names no placed source in the data
  note The shipment rides the Ravenholdt expedition at the end.

step Refuge Pointe - the captains paid

  turnin 681 -- Northfold Manor - Captain Nials
  accept 682 -- Stromgarde Badges - Captain Nials
  note 682's badges come from the Syndicate in the streets above - take the badges leg next.
  turnin 684 -- WANTED: Marez Cowl - Captain Nials
  turnin 685 -- WANTED: Otto and Falconcrest - Captain Nials
  turnin 94221 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Golden Rod - Muggol Breezebeard

step Stromgarde streets - badges

  complete 682 @25.39,63.4 era -- 7 Stromgarde Badges from the Syndicate in the streets for Captain Nials
  turnin 682 -- Stromgarde Badges - Captain Nials

step The circle - Keystone and Inner Binding

  tip The Keystone (36.08, 58.09) and the Stone of Inner Binding (36.23, 57.38) stand in the circle; the West (25.46, 30.11), East (66.7, 29.72) and Outer (52.04, 50.73) stones ring the zone.
  accept 651 -- Stones of Binding - the Keystone
  note 651's pre (642, the Princess) is a documented no-turn-in record below; the keys are gathered anyway, honestly carried with no invented turn-in.
  accept 652 -- Breaking the Keystone - the Stone of Inner Binding, beside the Keystone
  note 652's pre (651 above) is a documented no-turn-in record; the Rod runs to the Keystone anyway.
  accept 653 -- Myzrael's Allies - the Keystone
  note 653's pre (652 above) is a documented no-turn-in record; the chain leaves for Ironforge on 653 regardless.

step The northwest - Alyce's writs and the West stone

  tip Alyce (33.98, 23.32) takes writs in the northwest; the Stone of West Binding (25.46, 30.11) stands nearby.
  accept 94230 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Explosive Sheep - Alyce; have the Explosive Sheep in your bags
  accept 94239 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Fine Leather Pants - Alyce; have the Fine Leather Pants in your bags
  accept 94248 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Blue Overalls - Alyce; have the Blue Overalls in your bags
  turnin 94230 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Explosive Sheep - Alyce
  turnin 94239 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Fine Leather Pants - Alyce
  turnin 94248 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Blue Overalls - Alyce

  note The Burning Key for 651 comes from the Stone of West Binding; the other two keys ride the east leg.

  kill 2347 optional -- Wild Gryphon; its Hybrid Haunch goes to Skonk's dish down south
  note Skonk's grocery runs come on the southern leg; the Haunch rides in your bags till then.

step Eagle's Fist site - the figurine chain

  tip The Messenger Bag (22.48, 24.14) marks the Eagle's Fist site: the Carved Figurine banked from Loch Modan (see that companion) opens 79975, and the bag closes it here.
  when onquest 79975
  turnin 79975 -- Eagle's Fist - the Messenger Bag
  accept 79976 -- This Must Be The Place - the Messenger Bag
  turnin 79976 -- This Must Be The Place - the Hastily Rolled-Up Satchel, at the same point

step South - Foggy and the corpse

  tip Foggy MacKreel (43.24, 92.64) brews at the far south; Ebenezer Rustlocke's corpse (45.7, 93.1) lies nearby.
  accept 647 -- MacKreel's Moonshine - Foggy MacKreel
  note Foggy also stands on the Wetlands side; the quest's zone field keeps it here, and Bilger waits in Hillsbrad.
  accept 632 -- The Thandol Span - Ebenezer Rustlocke's corpse
  note 632's pre (631) lives in the Wetlands guide - take 632 after that leg; Rhag takes the parchment on the Wetlands expedition below.

step South - the courier and the plague chain

  tip Quae (60.18, 53.85) and Kinelory (60.24, 53.92) work the east camp; the Forsaken Courier (52.47, 61.53) walks west of it.
  accept 658 -- Hints of a New Plague? - Quae
  note 658's pre (659) is contracted in the Hillsbrad guide - take 658 after that leg.

  complete 658 @52.47,61.53 era -- the Forsaken Courier's Sealed Folder for Quae
  turnin 658 -- Hints of a New Plague? - Quae
  accept 657 -- Hints of a New Plague? - Quae
  turnin 657 -- Hints of a New Plague? - Kinelory
  accept 660 -- Hints of a New Plague? - Quae
  complete 660 @60.1,53.83 era -- defend Kinelory for Quae
  turnin 660 -- Hints of a New Plague? - Quae
  accept 661 -- Hints of a New Plague? - Quae
  note 661 ends with Phin Odelic in Southshore, on the Hillsbrad leg below.

step South - Skonk's kitchen

  tip Skonk (57.68, 74.65) cooks in the south; the Boulderfist Magus (50.43, 74.26) reads nearby, and the Sealed Barrel (21.3, 84) sits west.
  accept 79624 -- Anyone Can Cook - Skonk
  kill 2567 optional -- Boulderfist Magus; its Illegible Recipe starts Skonk's 79624
  complete 79624 @50.43,74.26 era -- an ogre who can read, with the Illegible Recipe in your bags
  turnin 79624 -- Anyone Can Cook - Skonk
  accept 79677 -- A Quick Grocery Run - Skonk

  complete 79677 @21.3,84 era -- the Smuggler's Spice Blend from the Sealed Barrel, with the Hybrid Haunch bagged northwest
  turnin 79677 -- A Quick Grocery Run - Skonk
  accept 79678 -- Taste Testing - Skonk
  turnin 79678 -- Taste Testing - Skonk
  kill 2557 optional -- Shadow Hunter; its knife goes to Kryten's Worth Its Weight in Gold up north
  note The tusks and pouches for 691 come from the Witherbark Witch Doctor in the ogre hills next.

step Ogre hills - pendant and tusks

  tip The Boulderfist ogres (31-35, 39-50) carry the Pendant of Myzrael, and the Witherbark Witch Doctor (30.52, 43.56) carries the tusks and pouches.
  kill 2562 optional -- Boulderfist Ogre; the Pendant of Myzrael starts 635, and Skonk's readers are kin
  accept 635 -- Crystal in the Mountains - use the Pendant of Myzrael
  note The data names no objectives and no turn-in for the crystal: the pendant's vision is the whole record, honestly carried.

  complete 691 @30.52,43.56 era -- 10 Witherbark Tusks and 4 Witherbark Medicine Pouches, with the Shadow Hunter Knife bagged south

