  turnin 691 -- Worth Its Weight in Gold - Apprentice Kryten
  accept 693 -- Wand over Fist - Skuerto
  note The wand waits on Kor'gresh Coldrage (54.75, 81.87) down south.

step South return - Kor'gresh Coldrage

  complete 693 @54.75,81.87 era -- Trelane's Wand of Invocation from Kor'gresh Coldrage for Skuerto

