  note Malin takes the letter in Stormwind, on the expedition below.

step East - motes, shards and the Rod

  tip Veyric Thunderhame (59.84, 27.57) watches the northeast coast; the Shards of Myzrael (62.5, 33.73) lie in Drywhisker Gorge, Fozruk (63.9, 30) holds the Rod nearby, and the Stone of East Binding (66.7, 29.72) stands further east.
  accept 642 -- The Princess Trapped - the Shards of Myzrael
  note 642 names no turn-in in the data; the Motes and the Iridescent Shards below are the whole record, honestly carried.

  complete 642 @76.02,44.39 era -- 12 Motes of Myzrael from the Drywhisker kobolds, for the Iridescent Shards

  complete 652 @63.9,30 era -- the Rod of Order from Fozruk, for the Keystone back west

  note The Cresting Key for 651 comes from the Stone of East Binding; the Outer stone below closes the set.

step East - Veyric and the bindings

  accept 96264 only Shaman -- Elemental Aid - Veyric Thunderhame
  note The Tattered Note comes from Charlga Razorflank in Razorfen Kraul; the instance has no map frame in the data, so take the note when you run the Kraul and report back with it in your bags.
  complete 96264 only Shaman @59.84,27.57 era -- the Tattered Note in your bags, for Veyric Thunderhame
  turnin 96264 only Shaman -- Elemental Aid - Veyric Thunderhame
  accept 79358 only Shaman -- Storm, Earth, and Fire - Veyric Thunderhame
  note The four Twisted Totem sets drop far afield - fire from the Badlands Dustbelchers, earth from the Swamp of Sorrows Lost Ones, water from the Dustwallow Mirefin, air from the Desolace Maraudine; none drop in Arathi, so bag them on your travels, never farmed in-route.
  complete 79358 only Shaman @59.84,27.57 era -- the four Twisted Totem sets in your bags, for Veyric Thunderhame
  turnin 79358 only Shaman -- Storm, Earth, and Fire - Veyric Thunderhame
  accept 96135 only Shaman -- Heed My Call - Veyric Thunderhame
  note The eye waits in Desolace on the expedition below; the ritual ends where the totems say.

  note The Thundering Key for 651 comes from the Stone of Outer Binding.

  complete 642 @84.31,30.95 era -- bring the Motes to the Iridescent Shards

step The circle - the Rod delivered

  complete 652 @36.08,58.09 era -- bring the Rod of Order to the Keystone

