  accept 663 -- Land Ho! - Lolo the Lookout
  turnin 663 -- Land Ho! - Captain O'Breen
  accept 662 -- Deep Sea Salvage - First Mate Nilzlix
  accept 664 -- Drowned Sorrows - Captain Steelgut

